  "party_positions": [
    {
      "claims": [
        {
          "attribution": "General Prelogar",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "3e46a8bdb64aefe3aed3ed2cc07afb471f671417e5d8ffb8077bcf4b710be9e4",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-3e46a8bdb64a-0001-0012"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 31,
                "start": 31
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to General Prelogar, the United States seeks the equitable remedy of enjoining implementation of an unconstitutional law."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "General Prelogar",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "3e46a8bdb64aefe3aed3ed2cc07afb471f671417e5d8ffb8077bcf4b710be9e4",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-3e46a8bdb64a-0001-0013"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 32,
                "start": 32
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to General Prelogar, the United States seeks an injunction against those who choose to involve themselves in the constitutional violation by filing suit."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "General Prelogar",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "3e46a8bdb64aefe3aed3ed2cc07afb471f671417e5d8ffb8077bcf4b710be9e4",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-3e46a8bdb64a-0001-0016"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 36,
                "start": 36
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to General Prelogar, if the statute attempted to apply liquidated damages to every S.B.\u202f8 plaintiff, it would apply to all of them."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "General Prelogar",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "3e46a8bdb64aefe3aed3ed2cc07afb471f671417e5d8ffb8077bcf4b710be9e4",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-3e46a8bdb64a-0001-0017"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 37,
                "start": 37
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to General Prelogar, the injunction does not reach the world at large or every possible person."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "General Prelogar",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "3e46a8bdb64aefe3aed3ed2cc07afb471f671417e5d8ffb8077bcf4b710be9e4",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-3e46a8bdb64a-0001-0019"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 39,
                "start": 39
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to General Prelogar, the relief sought is different from what providers could obtain because they lack a mechanism to identify or sue S.B.\u202f8 plaintiffs."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "General Prelogar",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "3e46a8bdb64aefe3aed3ed2cc07afb471f671417e5d8ffb8077bcf4b710be9e4",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-3e46a8bdb64a-0001-0021"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 43,
                "start": 43
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to General Prelogar, every injunction operates in the manner described."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "United States",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "3e46a8bdb64aefe3aed3ed2cc07afb471f671417e5d8ffb8077bcf4b710be9e4",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-3e46a8bdb64a-0002-0007"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 48,
                "start": 48
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to United States, if the state structured the hypothetical law in the same way, the concern would be that the state is effectively seeking to take the issue away from the courts."
        }
      ],
      "heading": "United States (Solicitor General Prelogar)",
